'' RUN: a program's own global 'hashvalue' wins in the program's code, and std/containers'
'' Map and Set still hash with the intrinsic (RFC 0019 R5): their generic bodies are
'' re-resolved in the importer's unit, and the scope walk out of the module's namespace bound
'' Mix's 'hashvalue( k )' to the program's function (TKO0698 in map.tiko).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/hashvalue-shadow.tiko -o tests/codegen/hashvalueshadow.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/hashvalueshadow.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/hashvalueshadow.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 42 2 2 true 1
